/**
 * The app's glyphs, by the SF Symbol names the iOS app uses, on a 24-unit square. SF Symbols are Apple's alone, so off
 * Apple's platforms iikb draws its own, as the keyboard does (`keyboard.Glyphs`), each measured off iOS's at one scale: a
 * symbol's font size is 17.6 units, so an icon drawn at a font size's 24/17.6 matches iOS's at that size.
 */
